ikoNikoNi", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198855692350/", "num_games_owned": 69, "num_reviews": 11, "playtime_forever": 11273, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 791, "last_played": 1771069182, "avatar": "d7a3e8eabb0df80ababaff027b9e1ec6bc4bc3ff"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "这游戏真的出乎意料的挺好玩的，在steam上找了一个月的游戏，一直在只喜欢玩pvp，没想到这次玩这游戏玩上瘾了。如果你喜欢pve还喜欢合作，那么这游戏的玩法和机制绝对值得你入坑。如果你喜欢pvp，那么不妨可以尝试一下多人合作类型的游戏。\n但是说实话，玩多了确实会有点无聊的感觉，因为任务类型就那几种，地图和人物也都就那样了。刚开始玩得有点无聊的时候想着深潜还没解锁，会不会是我没有玩过的新模式，结果打了一整个下午解锁之后就是连着多做几个任务，一个下午玩完感觉就是挺厌的。\n还有很重要的一点！！让我审美疲劳的，为啥不管哪个地图，这里面的怪物都是蜘蛛和蜘蛛还有蜘蛛以及蜘蛛再加上少数的其他苍蝇水母啥的，明明有那么多可以作怪物的形象，希望可以多丰富一下别的怪物形象\n还是希望这游戏以后可以出些更新，新人物，新怪物新boss，新地图甚至是新的星球，新模式任务类型新玩法（好希望有什么海里的任务）。每次更新都出些dlc内容让大家支持一下", "timestamp_created": 1621781951, "timestamp_updated": 1622224621, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "92470657", "author": {"steamid": "76561198844080453", "personaname": "Caijicxy", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/cxyccl2788285248/", "num_games_owned": 259, "num_reviews": 19, "playtime_forever": 7474, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2876, "last_played": 1780156986, "avatar": "6889e542266ff1eca9c32d7f405a723a0e19f756"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "有趣", "timestamp_created": 1621779520, "timestamp_updated": 1621779520, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "92469429", "author": {"steamid": "7656119